### SuperAdmin login
# @name saLogin
POST http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get T&C #1
GET http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/terms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}

### Update T&C #1
PUT http://localhost:5035/api/superadmin/terms/1
Authorization: Bearer {{saLogin.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
